  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sk Ibrahim vs State Of Ap on 4 August, 2020 Author: Ninala Jayasurya Bench: Ninala Jayasurya The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Ninala Jayasurya Criminal Petition No.2980 of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "2. The present Criminal Petition has been filed seeking quash of FIR No.180 of 2020, dated 28.07.2020 on the file of Bitragunta police station, SPSR Nellore District, by invoking the powers under Section 482 Cr.P.C. The said FIR has been registered against the petitioners for the alleged offences under Sections 272, 273 and 328 IPC and Section 59(i) of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 3.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners inter-alia contended that the registration of FIR against the petitioners under the said offences is without jurisdiction and the provisions of the said Act are not attracted to the facts of the present case.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners inter-alia contended that the registration of FIR against the petitioners under the said offences is without jurisdiction and the provisions of the said Act are not attracted to the facts of the present case.",
